{
  "_doc": "§31.13.16 方案C (TODO-GL-12) mandatory-floor curated override seeds. Keyed by the space-normalised syndrome id (hand.match(text).id with '_'→' '). For syndromes whose gold differential families are phrased as mechanisms/anatomy unresolvable by SNOMED is_a (adhesions, peliosis, foreign body, glucagonoma, pancoast), these few curated domains pin the standard differential so coverage no longer depends on the (structurally limited) automated partition. Emits the SyndromeAxisMap entry contract; merged as a UNION with recalled candidates. Each domain: name, axis, entities, mandatory.",
  "syndromes": {
    "leukocytosis": {
      "axis": "etiology",
      "domains": [
        {"name": "Reactive / non-malignant leukocytosis", "mandatory": true,
         "entities": ["leukemoid reaction", "reactive leukocytosis", "infection",
                      "infectious mononucleosis", "pertussis", "sepsis",
                      "corticosteroid effect"]},
        {"name": "Myeloid neoplasm", "mandatory": true,
         "entities": ["chronic myeloid leukemia", "acute myeloid leukemia",
                      "myeloproliferative neoplasm", "polycythemia vera",
                      "essential thrombocythemia", "primary myelofibrosis"]},
        {"name": "Lymphoid neoplasm", "mandatory": false,
         "entities": ["chronic lymphocytic leukemia", "acute lymphoblastic leukemia",
                      "lymphoma"]}
      ]
    },
